WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.670
- Well, when you impersonate someone,

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:04.280
do you try to keep it from being too mean,

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.010
or do you just lean in?

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:09.470
- No, I think, I don't
want to hit below the belt

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:10.663
if I can help it.

00:00:12.874 --> 00:00:14.870
I think we take enough digs

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.730
that you would have to be able to like,

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.430
know that you can look
them in the face someday.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.360
- Yeah, I always think
it's an honor, though.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.630
Like, I've been made fun of
before, and I think it's funny.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.780
I run into people and I laugh,

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.070
I'm like, that was good, actually.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.200
If it's good, you're like, okay.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.370
But yeah, I don't know.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.850
That's why I always love when
comedians host shows too,

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:36.560
like on award shows.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.960
I think it's way funnier,

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.793
'cause we love-
- Yeah.

00:00:38.793 --> 00:00:41.540
- To see celebrities get poked at.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.640
Who doesn't love that?

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:43.830
I love that. (chuckling)

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.900
- Right. Well, and I
think part of me is like,

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.020
I have to kind of find things that I love

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:50.110
in everybody that I'm playing,

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:53.190
because that makes it fun to do.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:57.336
And those are the things that
I like to poke the most at.

00:00:57.336 --> 00:00:58.530
- Agreed, agreed.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.930
Has anyone you've impersonated,
have they ever contacted you

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:03.400
and said like, thanks? (laughing)

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.100
'Cause you kind of, I feel when
you're impersonated on SNL,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.640
it's almost an honor, right?

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.590
Like, it just doesn't matter
if they're making fun of you.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:12.423
- That's a good way.

00:01:12.423 --> 00:01:14.550
I think that's the
attitude to have, Kelly.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.144
- I think so, too. (laughing)

00:01:16.144 --> 00:01:16.977
(audience members laughing)

00:01:16.977 --> 00:01:18.490
- Yes.

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:22.150
So, Erika Jayne from "Real
Housewives of Beverly Hills"

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:26.150
sent me golden-covered roses.

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:27.850
I didn't play her specifically,

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.700
but I basically played her,
a character named Candice.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:35.700
And then I did Governor Whitmer
from Michigan this spring,

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:41.313
and she was not happy with the
choice of beer. (chuckling)

00:01:41.313 --> 00:01:42.146
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:42.146 --> 00:01:43.102
And so she sent me-

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:47.582
(laughing) So she sent a
lot of Michigan craft beer.

00:01:47.582 --> 00:01:48.415
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:01:48.415 --> 00:01:50.250
- She really taught me a lesson.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.083
- Yeah. (laughing)

00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:51.916
(audience members laughing)

00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:53.263
- Beer's on every time, now.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.640
- And now I'm gonna poke at you more.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.010
So which of your characters

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.330
are you most and least like in real life?

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:03.930
Like, which one is like, ah,
that's actually a little me.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:07.340
- Well, I have to say, so I'm
a little Cathy Anne, for sure.

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.909
I mean, she's much
harder living than I am.

00:02:09.909 --> 00:02:10.742
(Kelly chuckling)

00:02:10.742 --> 00:02:12.980
And then, Girl You Wish You Hadn't

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.430
Started a Conversation With
at a Party sort of started

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.708
by me making fun of myself.
(Kelly sighing)

00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:20.097
- (laughing) I love that one.

00:02:20.097 --> 00:02:21.295
(audience members laughing)

